{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛鉤鎖\n身清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切清淨。一切障者，所謂業障、報障、煩惱障，皆得清淨也"}
